      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DRINK MICKEYS (1) has been a little hard to follow, missing the frame last time but was a Mix 5 winner three starts ago and has drawn 1 where he has six wins. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Has the ability and expected to go close. THREE GIRLS (8) has been out of the placings at her last couple of runs but turned heads when clocking a dominant 19.73 over 366m at this track three starts back. Has the ability and can find winning form again. SOMEONE'S IDEA (7) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at this track over 366m behind Zipping Kravitz (20.29) in a Grade 3/4. Cannot be underestimated. HELLO ELSA (3) won as expected last time – cannot be taken lightly.",
